! XRT-13 RR1(IOL 17.15)= ルート リフレクタ専用(vpnv4・l2vpn evpn)。P1 にだけつながり、お客さまの通信は通らない。
! 経路を配るだけなので MPLS(LDP)は動かさない。PE のループバックへ届けばよい= IS-IS だけ。
interface Loopback0
 ip address 10.255.0.52 255.255.255.255
 ip router isis CORE
!
interface {{ links[0] }}
 description to P1
 ip address 10.0.52.52 255.255.255.0
 ip router isis CORE
 isis network point-to-point
 no shutdown
!
router isis CORE
 net 49.0001.0100.0000.0052.00
 is-type level-2-only
 metric-style wide
 log-adjacency-changes
!
router bgp 65000
 bgp router-id 10.255.0.52
 bgp log-neighbor-changes
 no bgp default ipv4-unicast
 neighbor PE peer-group
 neighbor PE remote-as 65000
 neighbor PE description PE (route-reflector client)
 neighbor PE update-source Loopback0
 neighbor 10.255.0.41 peer-group PE
 neighbor 10.255.0.42 peer-group PE
 neighbor 10.255.0.43 peer-group PE
 neighbor 10.255.0.1 peer-group PE
 !
 address-family vpnv4
  neighbor PE send-community both
  neighbor PE route-reflector-client
  neighbor 10.255.0.41 activate
  neighbor 10.255.0.42 activate
  neighbor 10.255.0.43 activate
  neighbor 10.255.0.1 activate
 exit-address-family
 !
 address-family l2vpn evpn
  neighbor PE send-community both
  neighbor PE route-reflector-client
  neighbor 10.255.0.41 activate
  neighbor 10.255.0.42 activate
  neighbor 10.255.0.43 activate
 exit-address-family
!
